(
K05 (2026-10-07): element-target contact in 2D (contact_target_element_group,
manual Professional 6.105). The target is a 3 x 2 block of quad4
(group 2); the generated node_boundary holds every node except the two
interior ones (6, 7), as the Professional. A quad4 contacter (group 1)
with its lower nodes 13, 14 at y = 1.99 moves down at vely -0.03 into
the top side of the middle target element: the penalty exchanges
momentum with the side nodes 10, 11: after one step vely = -0.01 (13, 14)
and -0.02 (10, 11) (Professional 02-08-2026 the same).
GNU before: no node_boundary, no contact (vely -0.03 / 0).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
end_initia
mesh -follow_material -follow_material
timestep_predict_velocity -yes
node 1  0. 0.
node 2  1. 0.
node 3  2. 0.
node 4  3. 0.
node 5  0. 1.
node 6  1. 1.
node 7  2. 1.
node 8  3. 1.
node 9  0. 2.
node 10  1. 2.
node 11  2. 2.
node 12  3. 2.
node 13  1.25 1.99
node 14  1.75 1.99
node 15  1.25 2.5
node 16  1.75 2.5
element 1  -quad4 1 2 5 6
element_group 1  2
element 2  -quad4 2 3 6 7
element_group 2  2
element 3  -quad4 3 4 7 8
element_group 3  2
element 4  -quad4 5 6 9 10
element_group 4  2
element 5  -quad4 6 7 10 11
element_group 5  2
element 6  -quad4 7 8 11 12
element_group 6  2
element 7  -quad4 13 14 15 16
element_group 7  1
group_type 1  -materi
group_materi_density 1  1.e6
group_type 2  -materi
group_materi_density 2  1.e6
node_dof 13  0. -0.03
node_dof 14  0. -0.03
contact_target_element_group  2
contact_penalty_velocity  1.e10
control_timestep   10  1. 1.
target_item  1  -node_dof 13 -vely
target_value 1  -0.01 1.e-6
target_item  2  -node_dof 14 -vely
target_value 2  -0.01 1.e-6
target_item  3  -node_dof 10 -vely
target_value 3  -0.02 1.e-6
target_item  4  -node_dof 11 -vely
target_value 4  -0.02 1.e-6
target_item  5  -node_dof 7 -vely
target_value 5  0. 1.e-6
end_data
